+
+# Recently created users endpoint
+
+`GET /api/admin/users/recently-created` returns the logins of users created in the last 7 days.
+
+- The endpoint is paged with `Pageable` because `docs/api.md` forbids unbounded lists; sort uses the existing `ALLOWED_ORDERED_PROPERTIES` allow-list.
+- The 7-day boundary is computed in `UserService` from an injected `Clock`; the repository query in `UserRepository.findLoginsCreatedSince` takes the boundary as a parameter.
+- A `Clock` bean now lives in `ClockConfiguration`; new time-dependent code should inject it instead of calling `Instant.now()`.
+- The route does not clash with `GET /api/admin/users/{login}` because Spring prefers the literal path.
